{"ticker":"DHAMPURSUG","symbol":"DHAMPURSUG","instrumentId":3022408,"name":"Dhampur Sugar","industry":"NSE-Food-Packaged","about":"Dhampur Sugar Mills is a leading integrated sugar company in India, operating five manufacturing units. The company focuses on producing sugar, ethanol, and renewable power, catering to various industries such as food, beverages, and energy. In addition to sugar production, Dhampur's ethanol business plays a key role in supporting India's biofuel initiatives, supplying ethanol to oil marketing companies. The company’s co-generation business leverages renewable energy by using bagasse, a by-product of sugarcane, to generate power. With its diversified product offerings and robust operations, Dhampur Sugar ensures efficient use of resources while contributing to the growing demand for sustainable energy solutions.","website":"www.dhampursugar.com","location":"Bijnore, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:15:46.798Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":165.41,"changePct":3.2006488644871447,"week52High":207.63,"week52Low":110.48},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,082 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,998 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"32,694,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"65"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"2,714,066"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.21%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.89"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"12.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.13"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.41"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-24%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"11.74"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"9–27"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"5.4%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"37.8"},{"label":"Volume","value":"362,020"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"901,364"},{"label":"Master score","value":"58"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"54"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"76"},{"label":"Group rank","value":